  "details": "At some point, I couldn't log in to VRchat account, so I logged in as Steam ID and it became login. However, I couldn't log in with my VRchat account, so I logged in with a user name on the website and it said it was an incorrect user name or password. So I logged in to the site by e-mail, and I was logged in. You can't log in by user name, but you can do it by email. However, it is a problem because you cannot log in via email in VRchat game. What should I do?",
